# Harvey Games

Client-only game cabinet. No authentication and no server database.

- Public URL: `https://jeminpro.com/harveygames/`
- Public path is `/harveygames/`. React Router `basename` is `/harveygames`.
- Vite `base` is `/harveygames` during `serve` and `/harveygames/` for production. The dev server requires basename to start with base, and the production slash keeps asset URLs intact.
- Do not add a project `CNAME`. The custom domain stays on the user Pages site.
- React Router 7.18.4 framework mode, `ssr: false`
- Prerender `/` and each `/play/:gameId` from the catalog
- React 19.3.0, Vite 8.3.4, TypeScript 6.x
- Dexie 4.4.6 stores the catalog in IndexedDB. Seed from `app/games/catalog.ts`
- Phaser 4.2.1 runs only inside the play route, created in an effect and destroyed on unmount
- A new game needs a catalog entry and a matching prerender path
- UI: dark cabinet, warm off-white type, acid-lime accent, Syne and Outfit
